    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire a well-presented two-bedroom ground floor apartment in the highly regarded and well-maintained Maelduin development, ideally located just minutes from the main street of Dunshaughlin.\r\n\r\nThis attractive property offers comfortable and practical accommodation, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers, investors or those seeking a convenient home within easy reach of local amenities.\r\n\r\nA designated parking space is included with the property, along with a private storage shed, providing valuable additional space for bikes, outdoor equipment and general storage.\r\n\r\nMaelduin is a popular residential development, conveniently positioned close to Dunshaughlin town centre. Residents can enjoy easy access to a wide range of local amenities, including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational facilities, all within a short distance.\r\nThe location also offers excellent connectivity to Dublin and surrounding areas, making it an attractive option for commuters."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Kitchen/ Dining| 3.6m x 4.6m Tiled floor, modern kitchen units, tiled backsplash, integrated oven, hob, hood & fridge freezer, double doors to sitting room\r\nSitting Room| 5.0m x 4.4m Wood flooring, double doors to kitchen\r\nHallway| Wood flooring, hotpress, storage press\r\nBedroom 1| 3.3m x 2.7m Wood flooring, built in wardrobe\r\nBedroom 2| 3.3m x 2.2m Wood flooring, built in wardrobe\r\nBathroom| 2.5m x 2.4m Tiled floor, Tiled bath/shower unit"
      },
